      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the test. It has a small actual test method (`test_lengthOfMonth_specific`) but carries a huge amount of unused imports and unused data provider methods. I'll improve understandability by removing all unused code and adding clarity to the three assertions.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports and dead data-provider methods, keeping only the single `@Test` method with three inline comments that explain what each assertion is verifying (St. Tib's Day pseudo-month length of 1, and regular month length of 73 at both its first and last day)."
